### シナリオ (3)

<details><summary><b>[P0][境界] S-01 · Apply a coupon one second before expiry</b></summary>

- **Given** a coupon that expires in 1 second
- **When** the user applies it at checkout
- **Then** the discount is applied
- _関連_: AC3: expired coupons are rejected · <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- _理由_: Boundary of the expiry rule. · _信頼度_: 高

</details>

<details><summary><b>[P1][異常系] S-02 · Apply the same coupon twice in parallel</b></summary>

- **Given** a coupon that was never used
- **And** two checkout tabs for the same cart
- **When** both tabs apply the coupon at the same moment
- **Then** exactly one request succeeds
- **And** the other one gets a <code>COUPON&#95;ALREADY&#95;USED</code> error
- _関連_: AC1: a coupon can be applied once · <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- _理由_: Boundary of the expiry rule. · _信頼度_: 中

</details>

<details><summary><b>[P2][回帰] S-03 · Checkout without a coupon still works</b></summary>

- **Given** a cart without a coupon
- **When** the user pays
- **Then** the total is unchanged
- _信頼度_: 低

</details>

### リスク

- 🔴 **Missing expiry check** — AC3 not implemented <code>src/coupon.ts</code>
- 🟡 **No audit log** — Coupon use is not logged.

### 前提

- Coupon codes are case-insensitive.

